# Frontend Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values.

# API Base URL (default: /api, proxied to backend via Vite dev server or CloudFront)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Kakao Maps JavaScript SDK App Key (required for location-based store search)
VITE_KAKAO_MAP_KEY=your_kakao_map_key_here

# Performance Notes:
# - The frontend renders up to 100 items within 2 seconds (Requirement 12.1)
# - React + Tailwind CSS produces a lightweight bundle (~200KB JS gzipped)
# - No virtualization needed for 100 items; simple DOM list is sufficient
# - Build output target: < 300KB JS (before gzip)
